WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.162
In Module 11, we will build on everything you have learned so far and move into more advanced S Q L patterns.

00:00:08.162 --> 00:00:16.907
You will work with common table expressions, recursive queries, ranking, lag and lead, running totals, moving averages,

00:00:16.907 --> 00:00:20.631
and other window function techniques.

00:00:21.168 --> 00:00:24.650
The grain habit from this module will remain important.

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:31.370
Advanced S Q L becomes much easier to understand when you can explain what one row represents at every stage of the

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:32.421
query.
